  "title": "review: Shipped pool defaults gain Claude rows: claude:sonnet (1-5) and claude:opus (6-10), models.sonnet claude-sonnet-5-5; codex rows untouched",
  "spec": "Why: goal T-1403 W1. The first attempt (T-1405, task/T-1405) disabled the codex rows in the committed .orchestrator/pool.toml; the gate went red on seven existing tests that rely on the shipped defaults having Codex executors (test_cli.Cli.test_status_plain_and_json, test_daemon.Daemon.test_dispatch_active_* with no_eligible_executor, a KeyError 'ex'). Switching Codex off is a per-machine live setting the Planner applies to the checkout's pool.toml when the human cancels; it must never be committed (PR 28 turned main red that way on 2026-09-24).\n\nWhat, in the committed .orchestrator/pool.toml:\n- Leave every codex row (astra, luna, terra, sol, luna6, terra6, sol6) exactly as on goal/T-1403, including enabled.\n- Add an [[executors]] row id \"claude:sonnet\": provider \"claude\", model = the models.sonnet value, roles [\"execute\"], complexity_min 1, complexity_max 5, max_parallel 3, daily_budget_tasks 40, quota_group \"claude\", weight 1.0, enabled true. Mirror the claude:opus row's keys (pool.py:196-201 requires a claude row's model to equal models[tier]).\n- claude:opus row: complexity_min 6, keep the rest.\n- [models] sonnet = \"claude-sonnet-5-5\".\n- Keep [codex] on_exhausted = \"fallback_claude\".\nTests: tests/test_pool.py::test_repo_config_has_claude_rows loads the committed pool.toml through the existing loader and asserts the claude:sonnet row (1-5, model claude-sonnet-5-5) and claude:opus (6-10), and that with every codex row forced to enabled false in a copy of that config, pick_executor returns claude:sonnet for complexity 3 and claude:opus for complexity 8 when an account has headroom. If a pre-existing test asserts the old claude:opus band (1-10) or models.sonnet claude-sonnet-5, update only that assertion and name it in the result.\n\nWork on the task branch cut from goal/T-1403. Commit first, then run tests/test_pool.py, tests/test_cli.py and tests/test_daemon.py in the foreground (focused files, not the full gate); never background a command.",
  "inputs": [
    "T-1417"
  ],
  "acceptance": [
    "tests/test_pool.py::test_repo_config_has_claude_rows passes: committed pool.toml has claude:sonnet 1-5 on claude-sonnet-5-5 and claude:opus 6-10, and with codex rows disabled in a copy pick_executor routes c3 to claude:sonnet and c8 to claude:opus",
    "tests/test_cli.py and tests/test_daemon.py pass unchanged except assertions that name the old claude:opus band or the old models.sonnet value",
    ".claude/hooks/tests-green.sh wt/THIS-TASK exits 0"
  ],
  "scope": [
